  "details": "This is a story about an operation on a smartphone and web browser.\n\nWhile checking a friend's profile, you scroll down.\n\nIf I accidentally tap “unfriend” at that time, it is immediately executed.\n\nI would like to see a mechanism to prevent accidental tapping.\n\nThe web browser version also needs a Yes/No and “Are you sure? confirmation dialog is needed.\n\nAs below, which has already been discussed.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/unfriend-dialog-is-too-friendly-and-easy\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/optional-yesno-button-for-friendunfriend-button",
